# Auto-push to GitHub

This project uses https://github.com/ilaysandrusi/ilay_sandrusi_website.

After finishing file changes in a task:

1. Commit the relevant files (do not wait for the user to ask).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
3. Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).
4. If the working tree is already clean, skip commit/push.

This overrides the default "only commit when asked" behavior **for this repo**.
